{"title":"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 29","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In their base <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> representations, the integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> consists of a sequence of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/8/0e84b93cdfb6fff7a9d090e34212e05e8bfe42b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1985$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" /> eights and the integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> consists of a sequence of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/8/0e84b93cdfb6fff7a9d090e34212e05e8bfe42b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1985$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" /> fives. What is the sum of the digits of the base <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> representation of the integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/9/669964c0625127ad8e0bae1747ea4122b88b44c8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9ab$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/e/c8e4e1c70a01fed8f7ee78f6d7dd4479ae5797e5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)\\ } 15880 \\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ }17856 \\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\  } 17865 \\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\  } 17874 \\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\  }19851$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"523\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>By the formula for the sum of a geometric series, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/d/b6da348899b2ab637adfc13bd1c35a59b53a9987.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*}a &amp;= 8 \\cdot 10^0 + 8 \\cdot 10^1 + \\dotsb + 8 \\cdot 10^{1984} \\\\ &amp;= \\frac{8\\left(10^{1985}-1\\right)}{10-1} \\\\ &amp;= \\frac{8\\left(10^{1985}-1\\right)}{9},\\end{align*}\" width=\"283\" height=\"114\" /> and similarly <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/3/ef3998cb14dbc7d6460692f9b0673ebb0c693eb8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[b = \\frac{5\\left(10^{1985}-1\\right)}{9},\\]\" width=\"142\" height=\"39\" /> so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/d/a4d0b73a7c54a48e0a49aaf6f0101b9725700406.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*}9ab &amp;= 9\\cdot\\frac{8\\left(10^{1985}-1\\right)}{9}\\cdot\\frac{5\\left(10^{1985}-1\\right)}{9} \\\\ &amp;= \\frac{40\\left(10^{1985}-1\\right)^2}{9} \\\\ &amp;= \\frac{40\\left(10^{3970}-2 \\cdot 10^{1985}+1\\right)}{9} \\\\ &amp;= \\frac{4\\left(10^{3971}-2 \\cdot 10^{1986}+10\\right)}{9}.\\end{align*}\" width=\"298\" height=\"179\" />\n</p><p>We now compute the decimal expansion of this expression. Firstly, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/6/496d0264c8b2151231a342bfe12e0050c82aad07.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10^{3971} = 100 \\dotsb 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"135\" height=\"17\" />, with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> one and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/b/4ebf8e3d6a8e306da4059b59f123ad8931a0622e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3971$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" /> zeroes, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/b/04b8c6a8f4edbb1283291cd3dbf3791c5828bf06.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\cdot 10^{1986} = 200 \\dotsb 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"157\" height=\"17\" />, with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> two and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/2/9d2aea70a9495d66d81a8dcbdcb9dfd80923af93.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1986$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" /> zeroes. Subtracting therefore gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/7/7a7d5e2cb3aaeb2d06521dfeb0736a0fe6a87df1.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[10^{3971}-2 \\cdot 10^{1986} = 99 \\dotsb 9800 \\dotsb 0,\\]\" width=\"280\" height=\"19\" /> where there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/c/efcbd831d59ec62d4b5b880a40f393f0c1c599f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3971-1986-1 = 1984$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"189\" height=\"15\" /> nines followed by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> eight and then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/2/9d2aea70a9495d66d81a8dcbdcb9dfd80923af93.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1986$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" /> zeroes. Adding <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> transforms this to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/4/5b426608e41560d22e82dbc924b390d5788a48e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$99 \\dotsb 9800 \\dotsb 010$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"138\" height=\"14\" />, now with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/0/720f5fb2a0e5abdc47146ee04b58ef1bcae6b659.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1984$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"36\" height=\"13\" /> nines followed by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> eight, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/0/720f5fb2a0e5abdc47146ee04b58ef1bcae6b659.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1984$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"36\" height=\"13\" /> zeroes, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> one, and a final zero.\n</p><p>Using long division, and noting that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/a/49a95a70f7536f95576d1b65f73df59c482ba183.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$80 = 8 \\cdot 9 + 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"107\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/9/a89b8b5a0a936cebf995ab3fbd290bd3a499f5fa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$81 = 9 \\cdot 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"76\" height=\"14\" />, it follows that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/d/c0d1c79617d4c8ad909ee33fc3da8ed802fc8fab.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{4\\left(10^{3971}-2 \\cdot 10^{1986}+10\\right)}{9} = 11 \\dotsb 1088 \\dotsb 890,\\]\" width=\"368\" height=\"39\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/0/720f5fb2a0e5abdc47146ee04b58ef1bcae6b659.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1984$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"36\" height=\"13\" /> ones, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> zero, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/0/720f5fb2a0e5abdc47146ee04b58ef1bcae6b659.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1984$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"36\" height=\"13\" /> eights, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> nine, and a final zero. Lastly, using long multiplication and noting that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/7/2077b57b45b2a11f1c76fae975463c7fd5b418fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9 \\cdot 4 = 36$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"73\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/1/50107176480553080d8e2407905d3f7e51af7e4f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8 \\cdot 4 = 32$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"73\" height=\"13\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/a/2eaa9f80b8c6b913def8309d9ab1ae82ae78061a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8 \\cdot 4 + 3 = 35$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"107\" height=\"15\" />, we obtain <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/6/b263b4e0d6af2ab56e7202884dc0d559cfca0f77.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{4\\left(10^{3971}-2 \\cdot 10^{1986}+10\\right)}{9} = 44 \\dotsb 4355 \\dotsb 560,\\]\" width=\"368\" height=\"39\" /> where there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/0/720f5fb2a0e5abdc47146ee04b58ef1bcae6b659.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1984$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"36\" height=\"13\" /> fours, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> three, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/0/720f5fb2a0e5abdc47146ee04b58ef1bcae6b659.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1984$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"36\" height=\"13\" /> fives, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> six, and a final zero, so the sum of the digits is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/a/aba8d3cc7e29744c1d0d914031247c2debf2cdd8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*}1984 \\cdot 4 + 3 + 1984 \\cdot 5 + 6 + 0 &amp;= 1984 \\cdot 9 + 9 \\\\ &amp;= 1985 \\cdot 9 \\\\ &amp;= \\boxed{\\text{(C)} \\ 17865}.\\end{align*}\" width=\"347\" height=\"78\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Factoring out the 8 and the 5, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/5/02551639756038d5f6a9125f909e5eef55550fc5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[9ab = 10\\cdot4\\cdot9\\cdot111 \\dotsb 1 \\cdot 111\\dotsb1,\\]\" width=\"270\" height=\"16\" /> where there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/8/0e84b93cdfb6fff7a9d090e34212e05e8bfe42b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1985$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" /> ones in both numbers.\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p>This is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/b/f3b303130bcf49205b403b1e586907be1bb70fef.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[10 \\cdot 4 \\cdot (1000\\dotsb 0 - 1) \\cdot 111\\dotsb 1\\]\" width=\"246\" height=\"18\" /> where there is an initial <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> followed by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/8/0e84b93cdfb6fff7a9d090e34212e05e8bfe42b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1985$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" /> zeros and the second number has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/8/0e84b93cdfb6fff7a9d090e34212e05e8bfe42b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1985$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" /> ones.\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p>Multiplying then subtracting gives us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/1/c61c77dcedde2be932a00e55d2c09f661126cd65.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[4 \\cdot 10 \\cdot 111\\dotsb 10888 \\dotsb 89,\\]\" width=\"202\" height=\"15\" /> where there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/0/720f5fb2a0e5abdc47146ee04b58ef1bcae6b659.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1984$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"36\" height=\"13\" /> ones and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/0/720f5fb2a0e5abdc47146ee04b58ef1bcae6b659.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1984$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"36\" height=\"13\" /> eights.\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p>Multiplying one last time, then adding the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> at the end gives us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/8/e182c4d14268667e1a3346cf88e99a4a829c25e0.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[44 \\dotsb 4355 \\dotsb 560,\\]\" width=\"140\" height=\"16\" /> where there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/0/720f5fb2a0e5abdc47146ee04b58ef1bcae6b659.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1984$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"36\" height=\"13\" /> fours, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> three, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/0/720f5fb2a0e5abdc47146ee04b58ef1bcae6b659.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1984$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"36\" height=\"13\" /> fives, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> six, and a final zero, so the sum of the digits is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/9/18943303fbfeba5b9f3dcbd51f5be174e18d19f2.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[1984(4+5)+6+3 = 1985 \\cdot 9 = \\boxed{ \\text{ C)     }17865}\\]\" width=\"345\" height=\"28\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME\" title=\"1985 AHSME\">1985 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1985 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1985\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">Problem 28</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 30\">Problem 30</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1985 AHSME Proble